; Limit 03: no way to call a function that is not written in L0.
; Blocks every job that touches the OS: job 2 (write to fd 2, _exit 70),
; job 3 (malloc or mmap for a chunk), job 4 (read from fd 0), job 5 (write to
; fd 1), job 6 (getenv, pthread_*, sigaltstack, sigaction), job 7 (reading
; @l0_main_ret_kind and calling @l0_f_main from outside the program).
;
; arena_grow is `char *chunk = malloc(want);` in C.

(def arena_grow ((want int)) int
  (malloc want))
